test "python authz: account target-only mutation lacks owner scope"
  lang python
  expect VYQL-AUTH-095
  code
  ```
  @app.post("/accounts/<int:account_id>/disable")
  def disable_account(account_id):
      account = Account.query.filter(Account.id == account_id).first_or_404()
      account.disabled = True
      db.session.commit()
      return redirect("/accounts")
  ```
